  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bd29250f310f4c9fafa3f964639bf9c9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TextFin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::_Project.Scripts.ScriptableObjects.TransitionTextSO
  title: Estuary
  description: "Here I am staring at the ocean.\\n What was once the fuel for our
    fantasies has become your grave.\\n Reality tore us apart, and unlike you, I
    didn\u2019t have the strength to pull myself back together.\\n I can only hope
    to carry your name and your dreams far with me wherever I go.\\n The weight of
    my actions will forever be a heavy load to bear, I know that.\\n But, for your
    sake and for mine, I will do my best to not let that stop me.\\n And I hope that
    the next time we see each other, I can be forgiven.\\n I\u2019m sorry. Arthur,
    I am sorry."
